      "kind": "theorem",
      "index": 1,
      "label": "main",
      "name": null,
      "raw_latex": "\n\t\\label{main}\nProblem~\\eqref{prob} has a unique solution $u\\in C^2(\\Omega)\\cap C(\\bar\\Omega)$ and\nthere exist $\\Gamma,\\Gamma',\\Gamma''>0$ with\n\\begin{align*}\n\\Gamma{\\rm d}(x,\\partial\\Omega)^{{\\frac{2}{1+\\gamma-2\\mu}}}\\leq u(x)\\leq \\Gamma'\n{\\rm d}(x,\\partial\\Omega)^{{\\frac{2}{1+\\gamma-2\\mu}}}, \\quad\n|Du(x)|\\leq \\Gamma''{\\rm d}(x,\\partial\\Omega)^{\\frac{1-\\gamma+2\\mu}{1+\\gamma-2\\mu}},&\\quad\\,\\, \\text{as \n${\\rm d}(x,\\partial\\Omega)\\to 0$.}  \n\\end{align*}\nMoreover $u\\in {\\rm Lip}(\\bar\\Omega)$ if $1<\\gamma\\leq 1+2\\mu$,\n$u\\in C^{0,\\frac{2}{1+\\gamma-2\\mu}}(\\bar\\Omega)$ if $\\gamma>1+2\\mu$\nand $u\\in H^1_0(\\Omega)$ if $\\gamma<3-2\\mu$.\n",
      "clean_text": "Problem~ has a unique solution [MATH] and there exist [MATH] with (x,)^{{{1+-2}}} u(x) ' { d}(x,)^{{{1+-2}}}, |Du(x)| ''{ d}(x,)^{{1+-2}},&\\,\\, as [MATH] .} Moreover [MATH] if [MATH] , [MATH] if [MATH] and [MATH] if [MATH] .",
      "paper_id": "1204.0109v1",
      "spans": [],
      "env_name": "theorem",
      "assumptions": "Problem~ has a unique solution [MATH] and there exist [MATH] with (x,)^{{{1+-2}}} u(x) ' { d}(x,)^{{{1+-2}}}, |Du(x)| ''{ d}(x,)^{{1+-2}},&\\,\\, as [MATH] .} Moreover [MATH] if [MATH] , [MATH] if [MATH] and [MATH] if [MATH] .",
